{"text":"kuruntokai","n":200,"lines":["பெய்த குன்றத்துப் பூநாறு தண்கலுழ்","மீமிசைச் தாஅய வீஇ சுமந்துவந்","திழிதரும் புனலும் வாரார் தோழி","மறந்தோர் மன்ற மறவா நாமே","கால மாரி மாலை மாமழை","இன்னிசை யுருமின முரலும்","முன்வரல் ஏமம் செய்தகன் றோரே"],"tr":["peyta kuṉṟattup pūnāṟu taṇkaluḻ","mīmicaic tāaya vīi cumantuvan","tiḻitarum puṉalum vārār tōḻi","maṟantōr maṉṟa maṟavā nāmē","kāla māri mālai māmaḻai","iṉṉicai yurumiṉa muralum","muṉvaral ēmam ceytakaṉ ṟōrē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"mullai","tinai_ta":"முல்லை","speaker_ta":"தலைவி கூற்று","poet_ta":"ஔவையார்","speaker_en":"the heroine (talaivi)","poet_tr":"Auvaiyār"},"scan":{"meter":"nēricai āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"7 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"6×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 25, veṇcīr 2"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"āciriyattaḷai 15, veṇṭaḷai 11"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"பெய்த","tr":"peyta","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"பெய்","tr":"pey"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"த","tr":"ta"}]},{"text":"குன்றத்துப்","tr":"kuṉṟattup","foot":"tēmāṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"குன்","tr":"kuṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"றத்","tr":"ṟat"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"துப்","tr":"tup"}]},{"text":"பூநாறு","tr":"pūnāṟu","foot":"tēmāṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"பூ","tr":"pū"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"நா","tr":"nā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"று","tr":"ṟu"}]},{"text":"தண்கலுழ்","tr":"taṇkaluḻ","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தண்","tr":"taṇ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"கலுழ்","tr":"kaluḻ"}]}],[{"text":"மீமிசைச்","tr":"mīmicaic","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"மீ","tr":"mī"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"மிசைச்","tr":"micaic"}]},{"text":"தாஅய","tr":"tāaya","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தா","tr":"tā"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"அய","tr":"aya"}]},{"text":"வீஇ","tr":"vīi","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வீ","tr":"vī"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"இ","tr":"i"}]},{"text":"சுமந்துவந்","tr":"cumantuvan","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"சுமந்","tr":"cuman"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"துவந்","tr":"tuvan"}]}],[{"text":"திழிதரும்","tr":"tiḻitarum","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"திழி","tr":"tiḻi"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"தரும்","tr":"tarum"}]},{"text":"புனலும்","tr":"puṉalum","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"புன","tr":"puṉa"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"லும்","tr":"lum"}]},{"text":"வாரார்","tr":"vārār","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வா","tr":"vā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ரார்","tr":"rār"}]},{"text":"தோழி","tr":"tōḻi","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தோ","tr":"tō"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ழி","tr":"ḻi"}]}],[{"text":"மறந்தோர்","tr":"maṟantōr","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"மறந்","tr":"maṟan"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தோர்","tr":"tōr"}]},{"text":"மன்ற","tr":"maṉṟa","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"மன்","tr":"maṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ற","tr":"ṟa"}]},{"text":"மறவா","tr":"maṟavā","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"மற","tr":"maṟa"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வா","tr":"vā"}]},{"text":"நாமே","tr":"nāmē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நா","tr":"nā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"மே","tr":"mē"}]}],[{"text":"கால","tr":"kāla","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கா","tr":"kā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ல","tr":"la"}]},{"text":"மாரி","tr":"māri","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"மா","tr":"mā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ரி","tr":"ri"}]},{"text":"மாலை","tr":"mālai","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"மா","tr":"mā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"லை","tr":"lai"}]},{"text":"மாமழை","tr":"māmaḻai","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"மா","tr":"mā"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"மழை","tr":"maḻai"}]}],[{"text":"இன்னிசை","tr":"iṉṉicai","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"இன்","tr":"iṉ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"னிசை","tr":"ṉicai"}]},{"text":"யுருமின","tr":"yurumiṉa","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"யுரு","tr":"yuru"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"மின","tr":"miṉa"}]},{"text":"முரலும்","tr":"muralum","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"முர","tr":"mura"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"லும்","tr":"lum"}]}],[{"text":"முன்வரல்","tr":"muṉvaral","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"முன்","tr":"muṉ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"வரல்","tr":"varal"}]},{"text":"ஏமம்","tr":"ēmam","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"ஏ","tr":"ē"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"மம்","tr":"mam"}]},{"text":"செய்தகன்","tr":"ceytakaṉ","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"செய்","tr":"cey"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"தகன்","tr":"takaṉ"}]},{"text":"றோரே","tr":"ṟōrē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"றோ","tr":"ṟō"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ரே","tr":"rē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"பெய்த","parts":[{"text":"பெய்த","lemma":"பெய்","gloss":"rained"}],"gloss":"rained"},{"surface":"குன்றத்துப்","parts":[{"text":"குன்றத்துப்","lemma":"குன்று","gloss":"of the hill"}],"gloss":"of the hill"},{"surface":"பூநாறு","parts":[{"text":"பூநாறு","lemma":"பூநாறு","gloss":"flower-fragrant"}],"gloss":"flower-fragrant"},{"surface":"தண்கலுழ்","parts":[{"text":"தண்கலுழ்","lemma":"தண்கலுழ்","gloss":"cool turbid water"}],"gloss":"cool turbid water"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"மீமிசைச்","parts":[{"text":"மீமிசைச்","lemma":"மீமிசை","gloss":"high above"}],"gloss":"high above"},{"surface":"தாஅய","parts":[{"text":"தாஅய","lemma":"தாவு","gloss":"spread"}],"gloss":"spread"},{"surface":"வீஇ","parts":[{"text":"வீஇ","lemma":"வீ","gloss":"blossoms"}],"gloss":"blossoms"},{"surface":"சுமந்து","parts":[{"text":"சுமந்து","lemma":"சும","gloss":"carrying"}],"gloss":"carrying"},{"surface":"வந்","parts":[{"text":"வந்","lemma":"வா","gloss":"having come"}],"gloss":"having come"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"திழிதரும்","parts":[{"text":"திழிதரும்","lemma":"இழிதரு","gloss":"descending"}],"gloss":"descending"},{"surface":"புனலும்","parts":[{"text":"புனலும்","lemma":"புனல்","gloss":"even the water"}],"gloss":"even the water"},{"surface":"வாரார்","parts":[{"text":"வாரார்","lemma":"வரு","gloss":"he has not returned"}],"gloss":"he has not returned"},{"surface":"தோழி","parts":[{"text":"தோழி","lemma":"தோழி","gloss":"O friend"}],"gloss":"O friend"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"மறந்தோர்","parts":[{"text":"மறந்தோர்","lemma":"மற","gloss":"he who forgot"}],"gloss":"he who forgot"},{"surface":"மன்ற","parts":[{"text":"மன்ற","lemma":"மன்ற","gloss":"surely"}],"gloss":"surely"},{"surface":"மறவா","parts":[{"text":"மறவா","lemma":"மற","gloss":"not forgetting"}],"gloss":"not forgetting"},{"surface":"நாமே","parts":[{"text":"நாமே","lemma":"நாம்","gloss":"we indeed"}],"gloss":"we indeed"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கால","parts":[{"text":"கால","lemma":"காலம்","gloss":"seasonal"}],"gloss":"seasonal"},{"surface":"மாரி","parts":[{"text":"மாரி","lemma":"மாரி","gloss":"rain"}],"gloss":"rain"},{"surface":"மாலை","parts":[{"text":"மாலை","lemma":"மாலை","gloss":"evening"}],"gloss":"evening"},{"surface":"மாமழை","parts":[{"text":"மாமழை","lemma":"மாமழை","gloss":"great dark clouds"}],"gloss":"great dark clouds"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"இன்னிசை","parts":[{"text":"இன்னிசை","lemma":"இன்னிசை","gloss":"pleasing sound"}],"gloss":"pleasing sound"},{"surface":"யுருமின","parts":[{"text":"யுருமின","lemma":"உருமினம்","gloss":"groups of thunder"}],"gloss":"groups of thunder"},{"surface":"முரலும்","parts":[{"text":"முரலும்","lemma":"முரல்","gloss":"roaring"}],"gloss":"roaring"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"முன்வரல்","parts":[{"text":"முன்வரல்","lemma":"முன்வரல்","gloss":"coming early"}],"gloss":"coming early"},{"surface":"ஏமம்","parts":[{"text":"ஏமம்","lemma":"ஏமம்","gloss":"assurance"}],"gloss":"assurance"},{"surface":"செய்தகன்","parts":[{"text":"செய்தகன்","lemma":"செய்து","gloss":"having made"}],"gloss":"having made"},{"surface":"றோரே","parts":[{"text":"றோரே","lemma":"அகன்றோர்","gloss":"he who departed indeed"}],"gloss":"he who departed indeed"}]}],"literal":"Rained on the hill, smelling of flowers, cool turbid water / from high above spreading, blossoms carrying, having come / descending, even the flood, [yet] he has not returned, O friend! / He forgot surely, [while] not forgetting, we [remain]. / Seasonal rain of the evening, great dark clouds, / with pleasing sound, groups of thunder roaring, / coming early, assurance having made, he who departed indeed.","translation":"O friend, even the cool, turbid freshes that flow down from the high hills where it rained, smelling of flowers and carrying fallen blossoms, have arrived. Yet he has not returned. He has surely forgotten us, while we remain unable to forget him—he who departed after giving us the assurance that he would return before the onset of this season, when great dark evening clouds pour timely rain and groups of thunder roar with a pleasing sound.","modern":"தோழி! மழை பெய்த மலையிலிருந்து, மலர்களின் நறுமணத்தோடு, உதிர்ந்த பூக்களைச் சுமந்து கொண்டு மேலிருந்து பெருகி இறங்கி வரும் குளிர்ந்த புதிய நீரும் வந்துவிட்டது; ஆனால் அவர் இன்னும் வரவில்லை. மாலை நேரத்தில் பருவகாலத்து மழையைப் பொழியும் கரிய மேகங்கள் இனிய ஓசையோடு இடி முழக்கங்களைச் செய்யும் இக்காலம் தொடங்குவதற்கு முன்பே திரும்பி வருவதாக நமக்கு உறுதியளித்துவிட்டுச் சென்றவர், நம்மை முற்றிலும் மறந்துவிட்டார் போலும்; ஆனால் நாமோ அவரை மறக்காமல் இருக்கிறோம்.","explanation":"This poem is set in the Mullai (forest) landscape, which is associated with the rainy season and the patient waiting of the heroine. The heroine is speaking to her confidante, expressing her deep sorrow at the delay of her lover. He had departed on a journey, promising to return before the onset of the monsoon. Now, the signs of the season are everywhere: dark clouds gather in the evening, thunder roars with a pleasing yet painful sound, and the fresh, flower-scented mountain streams are rushing down. The heroine laments that while the seasonal waters have kept their time and arrived, her lover has failed to return, suggesting he has forgotten his promise while she is left unable to forget him.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.5],[0.5,0.7],[0.7,1.1],[1.1,1.8],[1.8,2.6],[2.6,2.98],[3.1,3.27],[3.27,3.9],[3.9,5.0],[5.0,5.4],[5.4,5.6],[5.6,6.0],[6.0,7.1],[7.1,7.5],[7.5,7.9],[7.9,8.2],[8.2,9.2],[9.2,9.5],[9.5,9.6],[9.6,10.0],[10.0,11.4],[11.55,12.0],[12.0,12.3],[12.3,13.3],[13.3,13.4],[13.4,14.09],[14.22,14.5]],"female":[[0.0,0.2],[0.6,1.1],[1.1,1.2],[1.31,2.1],[2.1,3.1],[3.1,3.48],[3.6,3.77],[3.77,4.4],[4.4,5.6],[5.6,6.0],[6.0,6.3],[6.3,6.6],[6.6,7.8],[7.8,8.1],[8.1,8.4],[8.4,8.8],[8.8,9.8],[9.8,10.2],[10.2,10.3],[10.3,10.7],[10.7,11.78],[11.78,12.55],[12.55,13.1],[13.1,14.2],[14.2,14.3],[14.3,15.21],[15.36,15.43]]}}